{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Super Scratch Cards is a Wacky Convenience Mart  Scratch Card Simulator!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553460/extras/description_header_coins.png?t=1745723694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;<i>You gonna buy something or not?</i>&quot; the Seedy Shopkeeper barks at you. &quot;<i>This Mart don't run itself.</i>&quot; Undeterred, you've set out to get some scratch. Scratch that, you're going to scratch them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Super Scratch Cards is a game by Strong Arm Studios.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553460/extras/description_header_fish.png?t=1745723694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect a variety of colorful cards to scratch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scratch cards across a gamut of gameplay styles; Catch fish, solve puzzles, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn a trough of tools to change the way you scratch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use cheat codes to alter difficulty, randomize items, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Befriend the local Seedy Shopkeeper to purchase rare items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553460?t=1745723694","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553460/d8f281e215fbc5099fbe9d902674f42b5372941f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745723694","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553460/93a98463e0a5fc1984cd8f75ea700df15f4a52bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745723694","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553460/93a984